{"unit_id":"songrui111__dsh-readprune#card-zh","repo":"songrui111/dsh-readprune","commit":"1f13cf988ba407f766a1f06a3388b17af018ead5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-readprune 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的上下文节省插件，提供延迟加载的工具和工具结果修剪。它注册 read_range，按行、符号或结构大纲读取文件，并提供工具目录与 fetch_recall 原文回读。它还可对指定网页和 shell 工具的超大结果保留摘要式片段并存档。适合长会话中需要减少文件读取和工具输出占用的用户；不需要 API Key，存档默认写入本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:445-563","index.js:566-618"]}
{"unit_id":"songrui111__dsh-readprune#card-en","repo":"songrui111/dsh-readprune","commit":"1f13cf988ba407f766a1f06a3388b17af018ead5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-readprune reduces context use in DeepSeek Harness. read_range retrieves chosen lines, symbol matches, or a file outline. A tool catalog lists available tools; fetch_recall retrieves archived text. Selected web and shell results can be trimmed; archives are local by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:445-563","index.js:566-618"]}
